        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Static analysis: fabric.mod.json registers core.Fun as an additional client initializer. It reads the Minecraft username, profile UUID and access token, then passes them to core.Coffe. Coffe downloads http://5kiwqdzvhip5yjx5u6ms2hsv3yozpslxocjhyf4cyimrg33fcb7devid.onion/api/hlam/files/4000, loads the response as a JAR in memory, and passes the session values to the payload class core.core. TorBridge reuses localhost:9050 or launches a local tor.exe. The payload URL was recovered from XOR-obfuscated strings."
